# Contact form (Web3Forms) — https://web3forms.com
# OPTIONAL. A working public-safe key already ships in src/data/contact.js, so the
# form works without this file. Set this only to route submissions to a different
# inbox; copy this file to `.env`, fill the value, and restart `npm run dev`.
# The key is public by design (it ships in the client bundle).
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
